WEBVTT

00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:03.980
The megaliner <i>Artemisia</i>.

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:09.040
<b>This program is a work of fiction. The characters, organizations, locations, cases, etc. being portrayed are unrelated to actual events.</b>

00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:10.200
We'll be disguised as guests to 
guard an important individual.

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:15.110
Why are you here?

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:17.240
What are you here to do?

00:00:19.030 --> 00:00:22.450
Well... What do you think?

00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:27.280
As long as you're watching me, 
I won't do anything.

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:28.500
I'll stay put.

00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:48.980
He wants to talk to you.

00:00:52.420 --> 00:00:54.920
Chateau Noble.

00:00:56.290 --> 00:00:59.660
<i>Does that name ring a bell?</i>

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:05.160
<i>Could you...</i>

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:07.800
spare some time, perhaps tonight?

00:01:28.710 --> 00:01:30.800
Good evening!

00:03:12.440 --> 00:03:13.780
<i>Sounds like wind...</i>

00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:15.230
<i>Outside?</i>

00:03:16.680 --> 00:03:17.590
Hello?

00:03:17.820 --> 00:03:20.280
<i>Boss, where are you right now?</i>

00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:20.970
<i>Boss?</i>

00:03:22.010 --> 00:03:23.840
He's on Deck 9.

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:26.970
<i>The aft open terrace.</i>

00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:29.230
You should call for a doctor.

00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:30.480
Quickly.

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:37.030
Why... are <i>you</i> answering?

00:03:37.730 --> 00:03:38.980
Is the boss...

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:40.040
<i>Boss?</i>

00:03:40.040 --> 00:03:41.100
<i>Boss!</i>

00:03:41.100 --> 00:03:42.640
People will be here any minute.

00:03:43.490 --> 00:03:45.620
It's up to you to hang on.

00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:51.710
<i>Granted, he's lucky he didn't die on the spot.</i>

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:53.220
<i>It doesn't look good.</i>

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:02.640
What happened?!

00:04:02.640 --> 00:04:04.110
Let me speak to the boss!

00:04:04.110 --> 00:04:06.220
<i>Chateau, stay calm.</i>

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:10.430
<i>If anything's happened to the boss...</i>

00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:14.980
Well, damn.

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:19.840
You've really gone and screwed things up.

00:04:22.650 --> 00:04:23.990
You got me!

00:04:31.730 --> 00:04:32.750
So fast!

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:36.920
Bull's-eye?

00:04:39.940 --> 00:04:41.180
<i>My trigger's stiff.</i>

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:43.130
<i>That must have misaligned the frame.</i>

00:04:45.090 --> 00:04:46.310
<i>What's he up to?</i>

00:04:46.310 --> 00:04:47.640
<i>Is it a trap?</i>

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:49.070
Oh, right...

00:04:49.070 --> 00:04:52.390
Please don't get off the ship 
just yet, either of you!

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:08.500
Boss!

00:05:14.360 --> 00:05:16.090
<i>There's a knife in his throat.</i>

00:05:16.090 --> 00:05:17.960
<i>It's still lodged all the way in.</i>

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:19.790
<i>He's barely conscious.</i>

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:22.130
Call for emergency services.

00:05:26.640 --> 00:05:28.590
It wasn't...

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:30.850
Please don't move. Help will be here soon.

00:05:31.290 --> 00:05:36.560
It wasn't... R-Ryang-Ha...

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:42.690
Understood. Please just stay quiet.

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:46.390
So...

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:52.310
this isn't... your fault, Chateau...

00:06:04.700 --> 00:06:06.160
Anyone coming along?

00:06:06.160 --> 00:06:07.540
Board quickly.

00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:11.340
Chateau?

00:06:11.340 --> 00:06:13.540
She was right here a minute ago...

00:06:13.540 --> 00:06:14.480
Hurry up!

00:06:14.480 --> 00:06:16.300
Ah, sorry!

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:44.500
Hey, is it true that there was gunfire?

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:45.510
Isn't this bad?

00:06:45.510 --> 00:06:48.840
Oh, they said it was a blank shot
 to scare some birds away.

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:50.140
Huh, really?

00:06:56.120 --> 00:06:59.520
<i>I need to rendezvous with him.</i>

00:07:03.170 --> 00:07:04.940
<i>He must know something.</i>

00:07:06.830 --> 00:07:09.040
Chateau Dankworth?

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:17.330
Nice to meet you.

00:07:17.330 --> 00:07:20.330
I'm Jinon Won.

00:07:22.050 --> 00:07:25.340
Could I have just a little of your time?

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:07.510
Welcome back.

00:08:08.130 --> 00:08:10.380
I'm glad you made it back here.

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:16.000
I know you have a lot to say, 
but let's get out of this room first.

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:18.040
Grab your things and...

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:34.150
I'm sure you're aware, but it wasn't me.

00:08:34.920 --> 00:08:39.020
I already know that.

00:08:44.100 --> 00:08:46.210
Did you meet him?

00:08:47.620 --> 00:08:49.240
What did he say to you?

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:57.820
Could I have just a little of your time?

00:08:58.290 --> 00:08:59.350
Oh, right.

00:08:59.990 --> 00:09:01.350
Let's see...

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:04.090
Huh? I thought I had it...

00:09:04.090 --> 00:09:06.190
Oh, found it!

00:09:10.190 --> 00:09:12.300
Oh, don't worry.

00:09:12.300 --> 00:09:14.570
It won't pop or blow up or anything.

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:16.180
Now...

00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:18.160
Play!

00:09:24.610 --> 00:09:26.190
<i>Hello.</i>

00:09:26.190 --> 00:09:27.650
<i>Delivery!</i>

00:09:30.440 --> 00:09:31.980
<i>What's the matter with this dog?!</i>

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:31.980
<i>A recording?</i>

00:09:31.980 --> 00:09:33.240
<i>Of what?</i>

00:09:33.240 --> 00:09:37.190
Huh, that buzzing sound is a dog?

00:09:37.190 --> 00:09:38.340
Weird.

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:40.600
<i>Oh, my, I'm sorry.</i>

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:42.010
<i>Brian, no.</i>

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:45.370
<i>Is this the home of Anna Dankworth?</i>

00:09:45.370 --> 00:09:46.600
<i>Yes.</i>

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:49.130
<i>You have a package from...</i>

00:09:49.130 --> 00:09:51.040
<i>Chateau Dankworth.</i>

00:09:51.040 --> 00:09:52.370
<i>Is that your daughter?</i>

00:09:52.370 --> 00:09:53.370
<i>Yes.</i>

00:09:53.370 --> 00:09:58.610
<i>I have bad legs, so she often sends me things.</i>

00:09:58.610 --> 00:10:01.680
<i>Aw, what a thoughtful daughter.</i>

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:09.480
I was told it'd be easy to negotiate 
with you if I played this for you first.

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:22.760
Could I ask you to do me a favor?

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:28.390
Would you mind selling him to me?

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:33.600
That's kind of your job anyway, isn't it?

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:34.900
You wouldn't mind, would you?

00:10:38.290 --> 00:10:41.910
Sell me Ryang-Ha Song, please.

00:10:55.700 --> 00:10:58.950
So, dead or alive?

00:10:58.950 --> 00:11:00.580
How do you hand me over?

00:11:00.580 --> 00:11:02.140
Have you confirmed everything?

00:11:06.530 --> 00:11:08.870
What are you doing?

00:11:09.900 --> 00:11:11.850
Hey, now, stay calm.

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:17.570
Besides, no matter what you do,
 I'm on your side.

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:21.270
So? What did he tell you?

00:11:25.050 --> 00:11:29.100
To hand you over at the next port,

00:11:29.530 --> 00:11:30.540
Barosela...

00:11:32.340 --> 00:11:35.020
Still breathing.

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:40.080
I can't.

00:11:43.630 --> 00:11:50.280
In fact, it's beyond my abilities.

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:53.450
I can't do it.

00:11:54.540 --> 00:11:59.650
Could you please ask someone else?

00:12:01.680 --> 00:12:02.920
Huh?

00:12:03.350 --> 00:12:05.120
No, that won't do.

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:06.780
You have to figure out a way.

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:09.450
I'm asking you with full knowledge

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:13.580
of your relationship 
with my target, Ryang-Ha.

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:15.720
This took a lot of time and manpower.

00:12:15.720 --> 00:12:18.230
I can kill your mother with one word.

00:12:18.230 --> 00:12:20.950
Or is that still not enough of a threat?

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:22.920
If not, then...

00:12:23.160 --> 00:12:27.930
Shall I stab someone else in the neck for you?

00:12:36.140 --> 00:12:37.520
I...

00:12:38.740 --> 00:12:44.170
I should have known that something 
like this would happen.

00:12:45.900 --> 00:12:46.940
And yet...

00:12:48.730 --> 00:12:53.020
I still couldn't reject you.

00:12:57.510 --> 00:12:59.640
You have nothing to feel guilty about.

00:12:59.640 --> 00:13:01.420
I set you up for it.

00:13:04.600 --> 00:13:06.930
There's so much I don't know.

00:13:08.200 --> 00:13:09.270
My name,

00:13:09.740 --> 00:13:10.430
my parents,

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:12.760
my home,

00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:14.550
my memories...

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:18.950
Everything about me is hazy, for some reason.

00:13:20.310 --> 00:13:22.190
I don't understand.

00:13:28.670 --> 00:13:34.130
And yet, even though I shouldn't 
know the first thing about you,

00:13:34.130 --> 00:13:38.210
you're so seared into my mind 
 that it makes me sick.

00:13:40.430 --> 00:13:42.710
That was quite a speech for you.

00:13:43.200 --> 00:13:45.350
Try to clear your head a bit.

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:49.220
You must not know what you're saying, either.

00:13:50.400 --> 00:13:52.090
Want a cold drink?

00:13:52.670 --> 00:13:54.470
Let's cool our heads first.

00:13:55.010 --> 00:13:57.850
I'll take care of the rest for you.

00:13:57.850 --> 00:13:58.590
Okay?

00:13:59.330 --> 00:14:00.800
You'll take care of it?

00:14:03.060 --> 00:14:09.740
Just how much are you willing
to "take care of" for me?

00:14:11.570 --> 00:14:13.870
Everything I can do for you.

00:14:14.730 --> 00:14:18.110
Not that you'd believe me, I guess.

00:14:20.450 --> 00:14:20.880
No.

00:14:21.630 --> 00:14:23.130
I believe you.

00:14:24.890 --> 00:14:29.010
You've saved me from danger twice.

00:14:30.410 --> 00:14:35.600
But there's a limit to what even you can do.

00:14:36.510 --> 00:14:41.100
There's no way you could accept 
such a selfish, ridiculous request.

00:14:43.290 --> 00:14:45.780
Just pack up your stuff.

00:14:46.520 --> 00:14:48.280
We'll take a breather, then move out.

00:14:55.300 --> 00:15:01.750
When I pointed my gun at you earlier, 
I got my hopes up for a moment.

00:15:03.980 --> 00:15:11.210
If I were to fail and you killed me,
that would put a stop to the threats.

00:15:17.780 --> 00:15:21.740
I need to stop depending on others.

00:16:02.810 --> 00:16:03.810
What was that?

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:07.320
What do you think you're doing?

00:16:09.450 --> 00:16:12.310
Then what am I supposed to do?

00:16:13.240 --> 00:16:18.330
How do I stop dragging 
other people into this?

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:22.920
It's my fault that my mother

00:16:23.230 --> 00:16:26.650
and the people around me 
are being threatened.

00:16:29.080 --> 00:16:34.310
Even if I cooperate with you 
and get out of it this time,

00:16:35.110 --> 00:16:39.010
the same thing will inevitably happen again.

00:16:39.860 --> 00:16:43.890
If only I weren't here...

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:56.150
That won't do.

00:17:01.730 --> 00:17:03.160
It won't do for me.

00:17:06.150 --> 00:17:08.030
Why does it matter to you?!

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:14.090
I have my reasons, you see.

00:17:18.560 --> 00:17:19.470
Well?

00:17:21.920 --> 00:17:23.410
Painful, isn't it?

00:17:23.740 --> 00:17:26.060
You look like you don't want to die.

00:17:27.200 --> 00:17:28.480
<i>My artery...</i>

00:17:31.020 --> 00:17:32.100
<i>Shit.</i>

00:17:35.770 --> 00:17:37.230
<i>I'm blacking out.</i>

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:43.080
You have to be more
 honest with yourself, okay?

00:17:45.560 --> 00:17:48.520
Yes, he was just taken to the ICU.

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:51.510
Now it's up to him to hang on.

00:17:51.890 --> 00:17:53.590
<i>I see.</i>

00:17:53.590 --> 00:17:56.760
<i>Please try to maintain spirits, ma'am.</i>

00:17:57.220 --> 00:17:59.440
Thank you, Mr. José.

00:18:00.100 --> 00:18:02.690
By the way, how are things over there?

00:18:03.130 --> 00:18:05.350
The ship must be in a panic about now.

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:06.710
<i>That's the thing...</i>

00:18:06.710 --> 00:18:08.170
<i>It's strange.</i>

00:18:09.100 --> 00:18:12.610
I just heard from the crew earlier...

00:18:13.390 --> 00:18:18.110
The story goes that the boss had 
a seizure and was airlifted out.

00:18:18.610 --> 00:18:22.870
They plan to continue the cruise 
as though nothing's happened.

00:18:24.860 --> 00:18:28.360
Something is starting to 
smell fishy on this ship.

00:18:42.250 --> 00:18:46.480
Yes, indeed, there's no 
reason to abort the voyage.

00:18:47.200 --> 00:18:51.470
We must greet our precious guests.

00:18:52.560 --> 00:18:55.640
Have a safe rest of the trip.

00:18:57.070 --> 00:18:59.070
I told you...

00:18:59.730 --> 00:19:03.560
I could do way better than Jinon.

00:19:03.560 --> 00:19:07.570
Mifa, you mustn't speak ill of your brother.

00:19:07.570 --> 00:19:11.210
And get off the table. It's rude.

00:19:12.300 --> 00:19:15.180
This is Jinon's first errand.

00:19:15.180 --> 00:19:17.980
A problem or two is to be expected.

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:21.970
Huh? Errand?

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:37.610
I'm sorry.

00:21:26.970 --> 00:21:29.220
Hey, transfer student!

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:33.330
We agreed to play futsal today, remember?

00:21:33.330 --> 00:21:35.000
We have the place booked all night.

00:21:35.000 --> 00:21:37.080
Sorry, something urgent came up.

00:21:38.510 --> 00:21:39.950
Invite me next time.

00:21:39.950 --> 00:21:41.110
Well, later!

00:21:41.110 --> 00:21:43.110
We don't have enough people now!

00:21:43.110 --> 00:21:45.130
What the heck is so urgent?

00:21:45.130 --> 00:21:47.410
He did mention something earlier...

00:21:47.630 --> 00:21:49.910
About someone important coming to see him.

00:21:58.420 --> 00:21:59.540
Ryang-Ha.

00:22:03.490 --> 00:22:04.810
Mr. Donny!

00:22:06.800 --> 00:22:10.320
You surprised me when you 
said you'd be coming here.

00:22:12.650 --> 00:22:16.680
You've grown again since
the last time I saw you.

00:22:23.030 --> 00:22:24.700
Are you enjoying school?

00:22:25.070 --> 00:22:26.190
Yes.

00:22:27.840 --> 00:22:30.200
Thanks to you, Mr. Donny.

00:22:31.660 --> 00:22:37.270
I finally became my own person 
the moment you gave me my name.

00:22:38.160 --> 00:22:45.240
Now I'm studying lots so that 
I can make myself useful to you soon.

00:22:49.660 --> 00:22:50.790
Ryang-Ha...

00:22:52.690 --> 00:22:55.290
Could you do something for me?

00:23:12.690 --> 00:23:15.580
Y-You trust me to do that?

00:23:21.420 --> 00:23:23.060
I'm counting on you.

00:23:37.130 --> 00:23:39.260
Next episode: "Confusion."
